description:
Partially update an AI Tracker (Brand Radar) prompt. promptId is the prompt UUID (from list_prompts). Provide any combination of name (<= 1024 chars), model (comma-separated engines: chatgpt, openai, claude, anthropic, gemini, perplexity, ai_overview, ai_mode), country, responseLanguage, period (daily, week or month), topicId (move the prompt to an existing topic, from list_prompt_topics) or topicTitle (move it to the topic with that title, created if missing); omitted fields are left unchanged and no topic keeps the current one. Moving keeps the prompt history. The result must stay unique within the destination topic. Pass the property ID (UUID) or URL (sc-domain:...) from list_properties.

Cost: 2 credits per call.

Examples:
```json
// change only how often a prompt runs
{"property":"sc-domain:example.com","promptId":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001","period":"month"}

// move a prompt to another topic (family), keeping its history
{"property":"sc-domain:example.com","promptId":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001","topicId":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002"}
```
